# gitignore 仍排除整个 build/。这里只把 Hilt/KSP 生成源码重新纳入 Cursor 搜索。
# 被排除的目录不会往下走，必须先一层层打开父目录。
# https://cursor.com/docs/reference/ignore-file

!lulu-spark/app/build/
lulu-spark/app/build/*
!lulu-spark/app/build/generated/
lulu-spark/app/build/generated/*
!lulu-spark/app/build/generated/hilt/
!lulu-spark/app/build/generated/hilt/**
!lulu-spark/app/build/generated/ksp/
!lulu-spark/app/build/generated/ksp/**
